      "locked": false,
      "text": "p20, after expand\n\n  22 values alive at the busiest point\n  42 pseudo registers over the whole function\n\n  a pseudo is a number. there is no limit\n  on how many the expander invents.",
      "originalText": "p20, after expand\n\n  22 values alive at the busiest point\n  42 pseudo registers over the whole function\n\n  a pseudo is a number. there is no limit\n  on how many the expander invents.",
