      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "x86-64\n\n  16 general registers in the architecture\n  -1 the stack pointer, which is spoken for\n  ----\n  15 the allocator may hand out",
      "originalText": "x86-64\n\n  16 general registers in the architecture\n  -1 the stack pointer, which is spoken for\n  ----\n  15 the allocator may hand out",
