      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 110866,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1466206,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                0    5    10   15   20   25   30   35   40\n                |    |    |    |    |    |    |    |    |\n  r134 reg 2        =======================================:=\n  r141 reg 43                                       ==\n  r116 memory                                         =====:=\n  r160 memory                                          ====:=\n                                                           ^\n                                           the second region starts here",
      "originalText": "                0    5    10   15   20   25   30   35   40\n                |    |    |    |    |    |    |    |    |\n  r134 reg 2        =======================================:=\n  r141 reg 43                                       ==\n  r116 memory                                         =====:=\n  r160 memory                                          ====:=\n                                                           ^\n                                           the second region starts here",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box013",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 492.9,
      "height": 262.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 118785,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1570935,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A live range is a set of program points, and IRA\ncompresses the point numbering first, so the numbers\nin a real dump are not source line numbers and not\ninsn numbers. For p20 it compresses 142 points down\nto 45.\n\nTwo ranges that touch anywhere conflict. The busiest\nvalue in p20 conflicts with 39 of the other 41\npseudos, so that part of the graph is a clique and no\nclever colouring gets out of it.\n\nExactly one pseudo has no conflicts at all. It is\nalive for two points at the top of the function and\ndead before the next load happens.",
      "originalText": "A live range is a set of program points, and IRA\ncompresses the point numbering first, so the numbers\nin a real dump are not source line numbers and not\ninsn numbers. For p20 it compresses 142 points down\nto 45.\n\nTwo ranges that touch anywhere conflict. The busiest\nvalue in p20 conflicts with 39 of the other 41\npseudos, so that part of the graph is a clique and no\nclever colouring gets out of it.\n\nExactly one pseudo has no conflicts at all. It is\nalive for two points at the top of the function and\ndead before the next load happens.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 840,
      "width": 580.32,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 126704,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1675664,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Two passes, and only one of them can rewrite code",
      "originalText": "3. Two passes, and only one of them can rewrite code",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 1061.44,
      "height": 60.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 134623,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1780393,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GCC does this twice. IRA decides, then LRA makes the decision legal, and they are separate passes with a\nhandful of others in between. The second one is still called reload in the pass list even though reload was\ndeleted in 2013.",
      "originalText": "GCC does this twice. IRA decides, then LRA makes the decision legal, and they are separate passes with a\nhandful of others in between. The second one is still called reload in the pass list even though reload was\ndeleted in 2013.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
