      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IRA, gcc/ira.cc\n\n  build allocnos from pseudos\n  compute live ranges\n  build the conflict graph\n  colour it, spilling when it must\n  write Disposition:\n\n  changes: which register a pseudo lives in\n  does not change: the insns",
      "originalText": "IRA, gcc/ira.cc\n\n  build allocnos from pseudos\n  compute live ranges\n  build the conflict graph\n  colour it, spilling when it must\n  write Disposition:\n\n  changes: which register a pseudo lives in\n  does not change: the insns",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box018",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
