      "text": "LRA, gcc/lra.cc, pass named reload\n\n  for each insn:\n    does it satisfy its constraints?\n    if not, insert a load or a store\n    or copy to a register that fits\n  repeat until nothing changed\n\n  changes: the insns\n  does not change: IRA's answer, mostly",
